WEBVTT

00:11:59.058 --> 00:12:01.986
that's going on during memory
consolidation and memory recall.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:04.174
So it's a short-term acute measure,

00:12:04.198 --> 00:12:05.356
but for goodness sake,

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:07.390
don't become addicted to alcohol

00:12:07.414 --> 00:12:09.483
as a way of getting to sleep every night.

00:12:10.095 --> 00:12:13.620
Another connection
between loss of sleep is weight gain.

00:12:13.644 --> 00:12:17.239
If you sleep around
about five hours or less every night,

00:12:17.263 --> 00:12:21.108
then you have a 50 percent
likelihood of being obese.

00:12:21.132 --> 00:12:22.855
What's the connection here?

00:12:22.879 --> 00:12:27.243
Well, sleep loss seems to give rise
to the release of the hormone ghrelin,

00:12:27.267 --> 00:12:28.424
the hunger hormone.

00:12:28.448 --> 00:12:29.600
Ghrelin is released.

00:12:29.624 --> 00:12:31.035
It gets to the brain.